{"3149680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Maple and Aluna", "steam_appid": 3149680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>&quot;If you ever leave this cold world, I want it to be for greener pastures, not for the snow in the sky.&quot;</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defy the world with your serenity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/44a04038d16b32867a7af96f9bd47522.poster.avif?t=1758336045\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/44a04038d16b32867a7af96f9bd47522.webm?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/44a04038d16b32867a7af96f9bd47522.mp4?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off an unending slaughter of monsters. Slay neutral camps and harness their powers to aid your invocation. Stand in defiance against the titans of the tundra.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture Altars and defend strategic points</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/611c477064faa00760a8755935c23535.poster.avif?t=1758336045\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/611c477064faa00760a8755935c23535.webm?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/611c477064faa00760a8755935c23535.mp4?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Altars to gain formidable buffs. Defend Altars from elite monsters to hold onto your new power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swap between Maple and Aluna</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/fb6026f2432ea2d874b99f4f493f1816.poster.avif?t=1758336045\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/fb6026f2432ea2d874b99f4f493f1816.webm?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/fb6026f2432ea2d874b99f4f493f1816.mp4?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take aim from afar as Aluna, or get in close with Maple.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Augment yourself with powerful Mystics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/961c4814609d8dec6a47d38b7670d2d3.poster.avif?t=1758336045\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/961c4814609d8dec6a47d38b7670d2d3.webm?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/961c4814609d8dec6a47d38b7670d2d3.mp4?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create specific strengths in your build to tackle any situation. Adapt in each run to survive as long as possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carry the weight of those that came before you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the world through the eyes of Maple, a soul from another world, as she confronts Aluna’s fragmented past. Traverse through the winter wasteland together, meeting new faces and in remembrance of those who once stood by your side.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>&quot;If you ever leave this cold world, I want it to be for greener pastures, not for the snow in the sky.&quot;</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defy the world with your serenity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/44a04038d16b32867a7af96f9bd47522.poster.avif?t=1758336045\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/44a04038d16b32867a7af96f9bd47522.webm?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/44a04038d16b32867a7af96f9bd47522.mp4?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off an unending slaughter of monsters. Slay neutral camps and harness their powers to aid your invocation. Stand in defiance against the titans of the tundra.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture Altars and defend strategic points</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/611c477064faa00760a8755935c23535.poster.avif?t=1758336045\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/611c477064faa00760a8755935c23535.webm?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/611c477064faa00760a8755935c23535.mp4?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Altars to gain formidable buffs. Defend Altars from elite monsters to hold onto your new power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swap between Maple and Aluna</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/fb6026f2432ea2d874b99f4f493f1816.poster.avif?t=1758336045\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/fb6026f2432ea2d874b99f4f493f1816.webm?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/fb6026f2432ea2d874b99f4f493f1816.mp4?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take aim from afar as Aluna, or get in close with Maple.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Augment yourself with powerful Mystics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/961c4814609d8dec6a47d38b7670d2d3.poster.avif?t=1758336045\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/961c4814609d8dec6a47d38b7670d2d3.webm?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/extras/961c4814609d8dec6a47d38b7670d2d3.mp4?t=1758336045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create specific strengths in your build to tackle any situation. Adapt in each run to survive as long as possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carry the weight of those that came before you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the world through the eyes of Maple, a soul from another world, as she confronts Aluna’s fragmented past. Traverse through the winter wasteland together, meeting new faces and in remembrance of those who once stood by your side.</p>", "short_description": "Fight together as Maple and Aluna in this action-adventure roguelike. Slaughter foes, capture altars, and augment yourself with powerful mystics to survive the eternal winter.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/header.jpg?t=1758336045", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/d116885968ba21cb33535cd2d87cc7fe28720f3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758336045", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149680/d116885968ba21cb33535cd2d87cc7fe28720f3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758336045", "website": "https://agon.gg", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU or better (1024 MB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Agon Interactive"], "publishers": ["Agon Interactive"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 59, "description": "Steam Input API Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Fam